          "merged_at": "2026-09-02T00:37:49Z"
        },
        "body": "Restore the frontend appearance to the exact pre-redesign state from commit eb7f78e0 (before PR #120 and all later visual passes), while preserving every backend/runtime/negotiation change made since then.\n\nThe only intentional visual difference from that original state is a tiny pricing-table fix: remove the reserved scrollbar gutter on `.price-brand-content` so the horizontal row separators in the `Posiadane boty` column reach the right edge of the brand sheet instead of stopping early with a white strip.\n\nScope:\n- restore original `AppLayout.tsx`\n- remove premium/redesign CSS layers\n- restore original global imports\n- add one isolated 8-line CSS edge fix\n- no API, backend, persistence, scheduler, quota, negotiation or runtime logic changes\n\nVerification against eb7f78e0: only `main.tsx` + the isolated edge-fix CSS differ from the original pre-redesign frontend.",
